  "2026-10-17T01:29:50.524Z",codex-agent,"Round 3: read the full unresolved PR 1 text-performance thread at ef95044. Plan: bound every input field to 512 code points at complete grapheme boundaries before XML validation, measurement and metadata; use cumulative glyph advances for linear ellipsizing; add deterministic measurement budgets, grapheme and boundary coverage plus a behavioral revert proof."
  "2026-10-17T01:32:51.225Z",codex-agent,"Implemented a bounded 513-code-point lookahead window and complete-grapheme cap of 512 before validation, layout and metadata. Ellipsizing measures each bounded glyph once and scans cumulative advances at grapheme boundaries. Revert proof: old ellipsize exceeds the 513-call budget both without and with the new cap; removing the cap fails exact/one-over boundaries. All 4 round-three behavioral mutations were caught and restored, including the tag mismatch check."
  "2026-10-17T01:36:20.672Z",codex-agent,"Final verification: npm run release:check passed with isolated HOME and clean Git configuration; bun run release:check passed sequentially. Each gate: 25/25 tests, zero skips/cancellations/todos, all src coverage 100/100/100/100, packed npm and Bun consumers passed. Focused pm test run passed 9/9. Revert proof passed 4/4 mutations; old algorithm fails at glyph measurement call 514 with or without the cap. Existing image snapshots pass unchanged. No remaining implementation risks found within the bounded rendering path."
